        "official_en_sha256": "f28ec80b92f86622149de4526767bb3d71eb69c5764a2417a86ff6fc4a3f90a2"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "こんなふうに誰かとゆっくり空を飛ぶなんて、\r\n今までに一度もしたことがなかった……。",
        "official_en": "I’ve never had the chance before...to fly slowly through the sky together with someone like this.",
        "real_en": "I've never flown so leisurely through the sky with someone before..."
      },
      "review": {
