        "official_en_sha256": "17740324f4746115145645ea63c408e32306653fe441774c5e6162260aa9758f"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だったら、そんな心配しなくていいって。\r\n俺たちが負けることは絶対にないから。",
        "official_en": "So you’ve got nothing to worry about. There’s no way we’re going to lose—we’re like a malboro’s breath: no getting rid of us.",
        "real_en": "Then you don't have to worry about that. There's absolutely no way we'll lose."
